<https://w3id.org/desmos/LiteraryConstraint> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://w3id.org/desmos/LiteraryConstraint> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/E29_Design_or_Procedure> .
<https://w3id.org/desmos/LiteraryConstraint> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Costrizione letteraria"@it .
<https://w3id.org/desmos/LiteraryConstraint> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Procedura formale o semantica che interviene nel processo di generazione testuale (F28 Expression Creation). La sua presenza può essere documentata attraverso evidenze oggettive (TextualFeature) o dichiarazioni paratestuali (E33 Linguistic Object)."@it .
<https://w3id.org/desmos/LiteraryConstraint> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Literary constraint"@en .
<https://w3id.org/desmos/LiteraryConstraint> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A formal or semantic procedure intervening in the process of textual generation (F28 Expression Creation). Its presence may be documented through objective evidence (TextualFeature) or paratextual statements (E33 Linguistic Object)."@en .
<https://w3id.org/desmos/LiteraryConstraint> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://w3id.org/desmos/> .
